{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "353b5035c12184fc09c5554c1dc87cd48746f0c99c944dcb56b6d1ee801b7670", "ja": "最後までバトル！", "zh": "战斗到最后一刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0d2ac274421b988b99be94fddb82ceef3e6598e274ccc0adcba852cbb4a307c4", "ja": "BOTのエンディング公演のアイディアを\n募集するプロデューサー。全力で戦ったと\n実感するアイドル達だが、未来は終わりたく\nないと駄々をこねる。悔いなく走り切るため\n最後の公演も『バトル』に決めるのだった。", "zh": "制作人正在为BOT的闭幕演出征集点子。\n尽管偶像们都切实感到自己已经全力拼搏过，\n未来却还是任性地嚷着不想就此结束。\n为了毫无遗憾地跑到最后，她们决定让\n最后的演出也成为一场“对决”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a3e487535db833d1a5b26e7d015975e491db94acd1af9a53cb27a2e2cbd7b6fc", "ja": "（BOTの有終の美を飾る公演にしないとな！\nとはいえ具体的にはどういう公演にするか……）", "zh": "（一定要把BOT的谢幕演出办得圆满才行！不过，具体要办成什么样的演出呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "567d8b047a6a987c2b6a9e0c0cabb87f4cbbe3a291bf5179bd3c7fa4311e3037", "ja": "（ここは、みんなの意見も聞いてみるか。\n今劇場にいるメンバーにまず声をかけて……）", "zh": "（先听听大家的意见吧。先去和现在在剧场的成员们打个招呼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "7193775e781b8e703323f0daeedd070840c279e299b7a3f02b43d028cf7ef5a7", "ja": "BOTのエンディング公演、ですか？\nそっかー、もう終わりなんですね……。", "zh": "BOT的闭幕公演，是吗？\n这样啊～，已经要结束了呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "2807f8984016696dd5dbefbaee0f6d08f1cb82e28df473431cbdb17240356d87", "ja": "ええ。始まったのはつい最近な気がするのに、\nなんだかあっという間……。", "zh": "是啊。明明感觉才刚开始不久，\n却总觉得一转眼就结束了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "8d6df361341910fecf9ec5aafe2904f02f49d4f21160bd51314aabba7850f2ce", "ja": "そう思えるくらい、全力で走り抜いたということ\nですわ。わたくしたち全員の力で。", "zh": "能有这种感觉，说明我们全员都拼尽全力一路走到了现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "c9c5a1bb4334e4acb0d75b95245c5de4b58015243ac61138cf0aadc5bf975cc3", "ja": "それで、そのエンディング公演の内容を、\n今日のミーティングで決めるんですか？", "zh": "那么，今天的会议是要决定那场收官公演的内容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f02687e6898c31a8647f271e278a48b2298faf655d4e1f668c99e067c59e8a5a", "ja": "今日は方針を決めるアイディア出しみたいなものかな。\nまだ決まってない事が多くて。", "zh": "今天主要是集思广益，确定一下方向吧。还有很多事情没定下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9f4078559272e243deba0513f6be97722c1a463ff9b7bbe735791e282e798f83", "ja": "ここまで精一杯BOTを走り抜けてくれた\nみんなの意見を聞いておきたかったから。", "zh": "因为想听听一路拼尽全力走到现在的大家有什么意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "5dde66360d923d7bc7907cc4ce37ae19092207ffed568eb24c1eb010c896dce3", "ja": "エンディング公演のアイディア……。ポンと\n気持ちよく出てくるといいんだけども……。", "zh": "终幕公演的点子……要是能痛痛快快地蹦出来就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "761eb0bd54470b7c939dccf34a9d1da202d5a5ecfe5642be882c53eaa7c4fbee", "ja": "？　未来さん、難しい顔してるけど\nどうかしたのかい？", "zh": "？未来小姐，你看起来一脸严肃，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "fb2f294e47f7a6fbafd43df993ba1912686c14320e0015391371726006941070", "ja": "あの……BOTのエンディング公演ってことは、\nBOTが終わるってこと、ですよね……？", "zh": "那个……说是BOT的闭幕公演，\n也就是BOT要结束了，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "892eebb361eef024524664afa4b5c6d49cb2d0beb92ae691ac2e75de174a2b79", "ja": "あ、ああ。\nそのまま言葉の通り、BOTの最後の公演だ。", "zh": "啊，啊啊。\n就如字面意思所说，这是BOT的最后一场公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "6adc566773412ec37f56aef85faf0e983328fdb7be055e52d44b47ca7bb81f31", "ja": "……イヤです！", "zh": "……我不要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "0187ee1936172137e06f04be49e47e04a6e64afc64805721d854811384aa0575", "ja": "私、もっとみんなと戦いたいです！\nまだまだいろんな、やってない対決あります！", "zh": "我还想跟大家继续比拼！\n还有好多好多没挑战过的对决呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8d883347020a881ddbc36decc4a5684c3f57b1434be214c423d67779d85ec95", "ja": "やってない対決かい？\nうーんと……。", "zh": "还没比过的对决吗？\n唔——……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "93c14dcb9b850b6d66a2c35704ba88561f042276a53b27e39aecdf25c52c4e4d", "ja": "あ、大食い対決とか！\nそういうのはやってなかったけど。", "zh": "啊，比如大胃王对决！\n这种我们还没比过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "9ec1b8ffd84d7dcc5defddb19a82f486a6aaed5fbed2b96593af1597b8f9db23", "ja": "そうそう！　まだまだあるよね？\nあとはー……漫才対決とか！", "zh": "对对！还有很多没做过的吧？\n还有——相声对决之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "ca33e2741775362ac5afe03075eb7bd4b60f310cea472b3eebef039f87383131", "ja": "漫才……。", "zh": "漫才……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "28d583a526f560ce4be45a165273ee5165487658e9a27f2eec9bc07877b87665", "ja": "私、静香ちゃんとやります！\nあ、翼も合わせて3人組でもいいかも……♪", "zh": "我要和静香一起搭档！\n啊，再加上翼的话，3人组合也不错……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "c24af3dc09d59ed2834a5d4bdcbc1443eff87400ab052fd8794d61e895777e2e", "ja": "志保と可奈も組んでやってみるとか！", "zh": "也可以让志保和可奈组队试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "074c98b7f1884bef3ce17b4919d1a8bf248e887e876c5b4375496a626eef3062", "ja": "どうして私たち……？", "zh": "为什么偏偏是我们……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "e2abde06998c9eb2ee358ee89e1d1ef092fcff7d286448ba6c20d2742b498f1b", "ja": "そ、そうだよ～。ネタ作りとか\n練習の時間、まず取れるか確認しないと！", "zh": "对、对啊～。不先确认一下能不能抽出时间编段子、练习什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "d48c6e982b3ca52f5f290d68405b917d192c5c3f41bb747f44936ce2c3759480", "ja": "……。\nそうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "……。\n不是那个意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "dac4ec2bbe20e7b052936867a41b4ce053699bfa7d86eea9810992c604bf67d7", "ja": "ふふっ。未来ちゃんは、\nまだまだ勝負し足りないのね。", "zh": "呵呵。看来未来还没比够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "6337befd69c53f92699877712de9001e5e86d30fef6c9ad2832efde01c4524f0", "ja": "{$P$}。\nここはいったん、未来に付き合ってみてはいかが？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n不如暂且陪未来较量一下，如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "1bc94dbd9c4c2b512bd57c3a36bdc1583ba762032524c88faa4476a8259d94d8", "ja": "勝負がテーマのシリーズですもの、\n心残りは可能な限り取り除くべきですわ。", "zh": "既然是以胜负为主题的系列，就应该尽可能不留下遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "50fa7320f1753841daa04fdf7c6be62b78ddeab42aa4d11dee4c95cd6272e6e2", "ja": "それは、なるほど。\nそうかもしれません……。", "zh": "确实，有道理。\n或许真是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "b2bbe2eaa2fd8e2b9fa29f41969733d8e6977cb7d8b8206f1089db831fa539ec", "ja": "せっかくのBOTエンディング公演。\n未来の気が済むまで、全員で対決をしてみるか。", "zh": "难得的BOT收官公演，就让大家一起比试一场，直到未来满意为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "5d4b98b954206cf1de9f88c141b116a870a955d3a35e381c84107ae86e5c3d48", "ja": "公演についてはアイドル全員から意見をもらう\nつもりだったし、みんなにも声を掛けておくよ。", "zh": "关于公演，本来就打算听取所有偶像的意见，也会去通知大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "f25547af06b26b69244b4e0d62ee8cf7179fd82bcff4007a644617f7dab6cd28", "ja": "やったー！\nみんなと対決だー！", "zh": "太好了——！\n要和大家对决咯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "6c14fee84789ac5074746d8a6c80422b2244c66bc5fc5e8e2653ec3994d3806a", "ja": "（未来は、仲間との勝負に消極的だと思っていたけど。\n終わりたくなくて、駄々をこねてたのか……）", "zh": "（我还以为未来不太愿意和伙伴们一决胜负。原来是因为不想结束，所以才在闹别扭吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0444_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0444_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "78626d77e4fd6d6dd5bda8a610c53c4220b11d989b2b0c612d423b1b1b01609b", "ja": "（だとしたら、いい変化かもしれないな。千鶴さんの\n言う通り、心残りのないよう、やり切ってもらおう！）", "zh": "（如果真是这样，那或许是个不错的变化。就像千鹤说的那样，让她拼尽全力，不留下遗憾吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
